Zomato Data Analysis Dashboard

 📊 Project Overview
An interactive Excel dashboard created to analyze Zomato restaurant data and identify key trends across countries, cities, pricing ranges, and ratings.

 🛠️ Tools & Skills
- Microsoft Excel
- PivotTables & PivotCharts
- Data Cleaning & Transformation
- Data Analysis
- Dashboard Design
- Interactive Slicers

📌 Key Analysis
- Total Restaurants
- Countries & Cities
- Average Restaurant Rating
- Average Cost for Two
- Top 10 Cities by Restaurant Count
- Restaurants by Country
- Restaurants by Pricing Range
- Restaurant Count by Rating

## 📈 Dashboard
The project includes an interactive dashboard with KPIs, charts, and a country slicer for exploring the data.

## 📂 Dataset
Zomato restaurant dataset containing information about restaurants, locations, ratings, pricing, and other attributes.


